    "directions": [
      "For yogurt mixture combine water, yogurt, salt, turmeric and whisk well.",
      "Now dry roast the bajra flour on low flame for 5minutes. Whisk in the roasted flour in the yogurt mixture and keep aside.",
      "Heat oil in a sauce pan. Add cumin seeds and let them crackle.",
      "Saute sliced onion for few seconds. Add all the vegetables and saute well for few minutes.",
      "Add in the yogurt mixture and cook on slow flame for 10minutes.",
      "Portion out the soup in the bowls and serve along with roasted papad."
    ],
